### Vulnerability: Unchecked Asset Receiver  
### Explanation: The contract allows the asset receiver (`Txn.accounts[1]`) to be specified arbitrarily without validation. An attacker could set `accounts[1]` to their own address, enabling unauthorized asset transfers.  
